            "size": "h3"
          }
        },
        "q_3_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the duvet filling included with the duvet cover set?",
            "answer": "<p>No. The Two-Tone Reversible Duvet Cover Set includes a reversible duvet cover, a bed sheet and four pillow covers. The <a href=\"/products/duvet-comfort-filling-220-gsm\">Duvet Comfort Filling</a> is sold separately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the bed sheets fitted sheets?",
            "answer": "<p>The Yarn-Dyed Cotton Satin Bed Sheet Set has a flat sheet that you tuck in around the mattress. Each product page lists exactly what comes in the set.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose the right size?",
            "answer": "<p>Measure your mattress, then compare it with the sizes in our <a href=\"/pages/size-guide\">size guide</a>. Our <a href=\"/pages/measurement-guide\">measuring guide</a> shows how.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does GSM mean?",
            "answer": "<p>GSM is the weight of a duvet filling per square metre. Our Duvet Comfort Filling has a 220 GSM fill for winter warmth without feeling bulky.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does yarn-dyed mean?",
            "answer": "<p>The cotton threads are dyed before the fabric is woven. This helps the colour stay rich and last longer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is ultrasonic quilting?",
            "answer": "<p>Instead of thread, the layers are joined with ultrasonic heat to create a raised pattern. That means no stitches to break and no loose threads.</p>"
          }
        },
